From: Rene Kita <mail@rkta.de>
Date: Tue Apr 16 20:11:13 CEST 2024
Subject: do_download
Patch: patches/do_download.patch

Make do_download a parameter for loadGeneralFile. Add an assert that it
matches the global variable.

Extra parameter ensures we changed all usages of loadGeneralFile. The
assert asserts.

Next step: use 'flags' parameter for all options, include do_download.

